If we do the calculations we get 
\[b_1+b_2+\dots+b_n\geq f(1)+f(2)+\dots +f(n)=(n-2)b_n+2b_1+(b_n-b_1)(\frac{1}{2^n})\geq (n-2)b_n+2b_1 \]
Equality happens when  $b_n=b_1$ . So we get that for equality to occur all the  $b_i$  have to be equal.

